{"speciesId":328,"names":{"fr":"Kraknoix","es":"Trapinch","en":"Trapinch","ja":"ナックラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"TRAPINCH’s nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit dug in sand. This POKéMON patiently waits for prey to tumble down the pit. Its giant jaws have enough strength to crush even boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"TRAPINCH is a patient hunter. It digs an inescapable pit in a desert and waits for its prey to come tumbling down. This POKéMON can go a whole week without access to any water."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its big jaws crunch through boulders. Because its head is so big, it has a hard time getting back upright if it tips over onto its back."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lives in arid deserts. It makes a sloping pit trap in sand where it patiently awaits prey."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It lives in arid deserts. It makes a sloping pit trap in sand where it patiently awaits prey."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il creuse un trou conique dans le sable du désert et se terre en attendant qu’une proie trébuche."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il creuse un trou conique dans le sable du désert et se terre en attendant qu’une proie trébuche."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit dans les déserts arides. Pour attraper ses proies, il se place dans un trou et laisse sa gueule grande ouverte en attendant qu’elles tombent dedans."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Habita desiertos áridos. Cava fosas profundas, en las que espera que caiga su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives in arid deserts. It makes a sloping pit trap in sand where it patiently awaits prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"乾燥した 砂漠に 生息。 すり鉢状の 巣穴の 中で 獲物を じっと 待ち続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il creuse puis attend ses proies dans son antre, un trou conique dont il est impossible de s’échapper."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Excava fosas cóncavas de las cuales resulta imposible escapar y espera a que una presa caiga en su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"絶対に 脱出 不可能な すりばち状の 巣穴を つくって 獲物が 落ちてくるのを 待つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le nid de Kraknoix consiste en un trou en pente creusé dans le sable, comme une cuvette. Ce Pokémon attend patiemment que sa proie tombe dedans. Ses gigantesques mâchoires sont assez puissantes pour croquer des rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El nido de Trapinch está situado bajo la arena, en una zona cóncava. Este Pokémon espera con paciencia a que su presa caiga en la misma. Con las fauces que tiene puede destruir hasta piedras."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Trapinch’s nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit dug in sand. This Pokémon patiently waits for prey to tumble down the pit. Its giant jaws have enough strength to crush even boulders."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"すり鉢状の 巣穴の 底で じっと 獲物が 落ちて くるのを 待ち続けている。 大きな アゴは 岩をも 砕く 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kraknoix est un chasseur patient. Dans le désert, il creuse un trou dont on ne peut pas s’échapper et attend que sa proie tombe dedans. Ce Pokémon peut se passer d’eau une semaine entière."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Trapinch es un cazador paciente. Suele cavar una fosa profunda en el desierto y esperar a que su presa caiga en ella. Este Pokémon puede aguantar toda una semana sin beber nada de agua."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Trapinch is a patient hunter. It digs an inescapable pit in a desert and waits for its prey to come tumbling down. This Pokémon can go a whole week without access to any water."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"脱出 不可能な 穴を 砂漠に つくり 獲物が くるのを ひたすら 待ち構えている。 水が なくても １週間は へっちゃら。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il peut survivre une semaine entière sans se sustenter. Il attend patiemment au fond de son trou, guettant sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Puede sobrevivir una semana entera sin comer. Se queda muy quieto en su fosa, esperando a que se acerquen sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It can live for a week without eating a thing. It waits patiently at the bottom of its nest for prey to appear."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"１週間は なにも 喰わずに 生きられる。 巣穴の 底で 獲物が くるのを じっと 待つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il creuse des trous dans le sable et brise les rochers qui le gênent d’un coup de mâchoire. Ses terriers ressemblent à un entonnoir."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cava su nido de forma cóncava en la arena y, si aparece una roca que le molesta, la destroza con sus grandes mandíbulas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"As it digs through the sand, its giant jaws crush any rocks that obstruct its path. It builds a funnel-shaped nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"大きな 顎で 邪魔な 岩を 砕きながら 砂を 掘る。 巣穴の 形は スリ鉢状。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa lourde mâchoire peut briser le roc, mais s’il tombe à la renverse, il ne peut plus se relever. Mascaïman en profite alors pour l’attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Puede triturar rocas con su mandíbula, pero su peso le impide darse la vuelta si lo tumban. Los Sandile sacan provecho de este punto débil."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its jaws are strong enough to crush rocks but so heavy that it can’t get up if it flips over. Sandile seize those moments as their chance."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"アゴは 岩も 砕くが 重くて ひっくり 返ると 起きられない。 メグロコは その隙を 狙うのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pour attraper ses proies, il bâtit un nid piégé et attend patiemment. Lorsque la nuit tombe, il s’enfouit dans le sable pour dormir."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Construye un nido, que también sirve de trampa, y espera pacientemente a su presa. Durante la noche duerme enterrado en la arena."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It builds nests that double as traps, lying in wait for its prey to get caught. When night falls, it digs itself a spot beneath the sand to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"罠を 兼ねた 巣を 作り ひたすら 獲物を 待ちかまえる。 夜になると 砂に 潜り 寝る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est impossible de s’échapper de son antre en forme de cône qu’il creuse dans le sable du désert."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Si una presa cae en las fosas cóncavas de arena que cava en el desierto, no podrá salir de ellas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"砂漠に つくられた 巣穴は すり鉢の 形を しているので 落ちてしまうと 脱出不可能。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il creuse, puis attend ses proies dans son antre en forme de cône, dont il est impossible de s’échapper."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Excava fosas cóncavas, de las cuales resulta imposible escapar, y espera a que una presa caiga en su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"絶対に 脱出 不可能な すり鉢状の 巣穴を つくって 獲物が 落ちてくるのを 待つ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":328,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",9],[6,"level-up",9],[7,"level-up",9],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",9],[13,"level-up",9],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"leve